# Curriculum adherence

- Align lessons and assessments to Ontario curriculum expectations.
- For MCF3M, query `courses/MCF3M/curriculum/mcf3m.sqlite` or markdown mirrors — do **not** invent expectation codes or wording.
- Keep overall vs specific expectations distinct; link examples to their parent expectation.
- Prefer expectation codes (e.g. `A1.3`, `B3.2`) in teacher/agent docs; student-facing text can be plain language.
- Source PDF: `courses/MCF3M/sources/ontario-math-curriculum-gr-11-12.pdf`
- If extraction is incomplete or unverified, mark it clearly — never silently fabricate.
